  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The distance between two point masses, <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"M_{A}\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"M_{B}\"></span> is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"R\"></span>. The gravitational field strength at C is zero. The distance between points A and C is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"s\"></span>.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>What is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{M_{A}}{M_{B}}\"></span>?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{R-s}{s}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{s}{R-s}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{s^{2}}{\\left ( R-s \\right )^{2}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\left ( R-s \\right )^{2}}{s^{2}}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
